<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="section product-section"><div class="container product-grid"><div class="product-visual"><img src="<%= drone.image %>" alt="<%= drone.name %> drone platform"><span class="product-label">FALCON / <%= drone.category.toUpperCase() %></span></div><div class="product-info"><div class="eyebrow"><%= drone.category %></div><h1><%= drone.name %></h1><p class="lead"><%= drone.description %></p><div class="product-actions"><button class="btn btn-gold" onclick="openQuote('<%= drone.name %>')">Request a quote <span>↗</span></button><a class="text-link" href="#order">Order request <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="spec-list"><% Object.entries(drone.specs).forEach(([k,v])=>{ %><div><span><%= k %></span><strong><%= v %></strong></div><% }) %></div><p class="fineprint">* Final performance depends on airframe configuration, payload, battery, environment and mission setup.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark product-story"><div class="container story-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow light">PLATFORM NOTES</div><h2>Designed around the operation.</h2></div><div><p><%= drone.description %></p><p>Final configuration can be discussed with Falcon sales based on payload, battery, navigation, cleaning hardware and the intended operating environment.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="order"><div class="container form-shell"><div class="form-intro"><div class="eyebrow">ORDER / CONFIGURATION</div><h2>Tell us what you need.</h2><p>This is an order request, not an automatic payment. Our team will confirm configuration, availability and commercial terms with you.</p></div><form onsubmit="submitOrder(event)"><input type="hidden" name="drone" value="<%= drone.name %>"><div class="formgrid"><div class="field"><label>Name *</label><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></div><div class="field"><label>Phone *</label><input name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required></div><div class="field"><label>Email *</label><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div><div class="field"><label>Quantity</label><input name="quantity" type="number" min="1" value="1"></div><div class="field full"><label>Delivery address</label><textarea name="address"></textarea></div><div class="field full"><label>Notes / configuration</label><textarea name="notes" placeholder="Payload, battery, mission or other requirements..."></textarea></div></div><button class="btn btn-dark" type="submit">Submit order request <span>↗</span></button><div class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div></form></div></section>
<div class="modal" id="quoteModal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modalbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="quoteTitle"><div class="modalhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">FALCON SALES</div><h2 id="quoteTitle">Request a quote</h2></div><button class="close" type="button" onclick="closeModal()" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><form onsubmit="submitQuote(event)"><input type="hidden" id="quoteDrone" name="drone"><div class="formgrid"><div class="field"><label>Your name *</label><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></div><div class="field"><label>Phone *</label><input name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required></div><div class="field"><label>Email *</label><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div><div class="field full"><label>Message</label><textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us about the site, payload or mission..."></textarea></div></div><button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Send request <span>↗</span></button><div class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div></form></div></div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
